[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0101","question_id":"CQ-Q0101","question_text":"蝉圈圈电脑端怎么登录？","category":"品牌认知型","pool":"扩展池","sample_date":"2026-10-12","repeat_index":1,"citation_state":"pass","card_count":24,"valid_url_cards":18,"unique_url_events":14,"official_events":8,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"234caa6298766a8437943a67c5de44a092e06de519b0b1b99eae82714539daa7","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":["explanation_accuracy","positioning_accuracy"],"recommendation_applicable":false,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# ✅蝉圈圈电脑端登录（网页版，无客户端软件）\n蝉圈圈PC端是网页系统，直接浏览器打开登录：\n1. 电脑浏览器（推荐Chrome/Edge）访问登录页：**https://www.kolkoc.com/login**\n2. 登录二选一：\n    - **手机号+短信验证码登录**（最常用）\n    - **手机号+密码登录**（提前设置过密码才可用）\n3. 输入信息，完成验证即可进入后台\n\n> ⚠️重要：蝉圈圈**属于邀请制**，需要先注册开通账号（找蝉圈圈商务拿邀请码注册），没有账号无法直接登录；员工账号由公司管理员在后台添加/发邀请链接加入企业空间。\n\n## 常见问题\n1. 打不开网页：清理浏览器缓存，换浏览器，关闭广告拦截插件\n2. 收不到验证码：检查手机号是否正确、拦截短信\n3. 员工登录：管理员给你的手机号开通权限后，用这个手机号登录即可\n\n## 备用AI版登录地址\nhttps://ai.kolkoc.com/#/login\n\n需要我补充蝉圈圈注册开通的完整步骤吗？","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0101","question_id":"CQ-Q0101","citation_id":"smp-e5d61c5b6f2e45c38e1076a940087b54:1","title":"登录入口 - 蝉圈圈","raw_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/login","normalized_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/login","host":"www.kolkoc.com","source_type":"official","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0101","question_id":"CQ-Q0101","citation_id":"smp-e5d61c5b6f2e45c38e1076a940087b54:2","title":"一键建联1000+达人，蝉圈圈AI商务员工开启高效达人合作新篇章 - 蝉圈圈","raw_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/news/793.html","normalized_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/news/793.html","host":"www.kolkoc.com","source_type":"official","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0101","question_id":"CQ-Q0101","citation_id":"smp-e5d61c5b6f2e45c38e1076a940087b54:3","title":"隐私政策 - 蝉圈圈","raw_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/other/priva