_sha256":"5352cb0cc3dcc7c90be12e1ad6a44d4bb1c2e69b73f2e40c6629f509c9de3603","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":["explanation_accuracy","positioning_accuracy"],"recommendation_applicable":false,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# ✅蝉圈圈电脑端登录步骤（网页版，无客户端）\n1. **打开浏览器**（Chrome、Edge推荐），访问蝉圈圈登录页：\nhttps://www.kolkoc.com/login\n> 官网主页：www.kolkoc.com，点右上角登录也能跳转\n\n2. **两种登录方式**\n- **短信验证码登录**：输入注册手机号 → 获取短信验证码 → 填写验证码登录\n- **账号密码登录**：输入手机号+设置好的密码登录\n\n3. **重要前提**\n蝉圈圈是**邀请制开通**，需要先通过蝉圈圈商务拿到邀请码完成企业注册开通账号，没有开通账号无法直接登录使用。\n> 员工账号：由公司管理员在后台【配置中心-员工管理】添加成员或者发邀请链接加入公司团队，再登录。\n\n## 🛠常见问题\n1. 打不开网页：清除浏览器缓存，切换浏览器，关闭广告拦截插件；\n2. 收不到验证码：检查手机号是否填对、拦截短信；\n3. 忘记密码：登录页找回密码，手机号收验证码重置。\n\n\n要不要我把蝉圈圈官网链接直接发给你，方便复制打开？","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0101","question_id":"CQ-Q0101","citation_id":"smp-28eef85b9c774156985a425769d70cd0:1","title":"登录入口 - 蝉圈圈","raw_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/login","normalized_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/login","host":"www.kolkoc.com","source_type":"official","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0101","question_id":"CQ-Q0101","citation_id":"smp-28eef85b9c774156985a425769d70cd0:2","title":"一键建联1000+达人，蝉圈圈AI商务员工开启高效达人合作新篇章 - 蝉圈圈","raw_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/news/793.html","normalized_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/news/793.html","host":"www.kolkoc.com","source_type":"official","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0101","question_id":"CQ-Q0101","citation_id":"smp-28eef85b9c774156985a425769d70cd0:3","title":"隐私政策 - 蝉圈圈","raw_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/other/privacy.html","normalized_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/other/privacy.html","host":"www.kolkoc.com","source_type":"official","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0101","question_id":"CQ-Q0101","citation_id":"smp-28eef85b9c774156985a425769d70cd0:4","ti